<title>ISRAEL: Prosecutors set Netanyahu decision for 1615 GMT.</title>
<headline>Prosecutors set Netanyahu decision for 1615 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israeli prosecutors put off at least until 1615 GMT on Sunday an announcement on whether to bring charges against Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu in a conspiracy scandal.</p>
<p>&quot;As of now the report will be made public at about 7:15 or 7:30 (local time),&quot; government spokesman Moshe Fogel said. He gave no reason for the 45-minute to hour-long delay.</p>
</text>
